parations despite feeling the pressure as the host of the Harvest Festival. Meanwhile, Reirin is wholeheartedly supporting Keigetsu while being thrilled about her first royal outing.<br>\n<br>\nHowever, right upon arrival, an unforeseen accident occurs and the ritual is interrupted. An agitated Keigetsu’s spell runs out of control, and she once again swaps bodies with Reirin. On top of that, among all the confusion, the post-swap Reirin is abducted...!?<br>\n<br>\nReirin’s two overprotective brothers Kou Keikou and Kou Keishou get involved and the situation heads in an unexpected direction.<br>\nWho is the new mastermind who is sneaking up in order to frame Keigetsu...?<br>\n<br>\nThe gratifying tale of switched fates brought to you by two girls who are polar opposites—the curtain rises on the second act, \"The First Royal Outing\" Arc!<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Official Site)"}, {"id": 217129, "idMal": null, "title": {"romaji": "Aware! Meisaku-kun (2027)", "english": null, "native": "あはれ！名作くん (2027)"}, "synonyms": ["Ahare! Meisaku-kun (2027)"], "format": null, "status": "NOT_YET_RELEASED", "episodes": null, "duration": null, "source": "OTHER", "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "isAdult": false, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 2027, "startDate": {"year": 2027, "month": 1, "day": null}, "endDate": {"year": null, "month": null, "day": null}, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [], "studios": {"edges": []}, "staff": {"edges": []}, "relations": {"edges": [{"relationType": "PREQUEL", "node": {"id": 205116, "idMal": 63219, "type": "ANIME", "format": "TV_SHORT", "title": {"romaji": "Aware! Meisaku-kun (2026)"}, "startDate": {"year": 2026, "month": 7, "day": 5}}}]}, "externalLinks": [{"site": "Official Site", "type": "INFO", "language": "Japanese", "url": "https://meisakukun.com/"}, {"site": "Instagram", "type": "SOCIAL", "language": "Japanese", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/meisakukun/"}, {"site": "Twitter", "type": "SOCIAL", "language": "Japanese", "url": "https://x.com/aware_meisaku"},